      "id": "nt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 710,
      "width": 1091.2,
      "height": 40.0,
      "text": "Note: the sending service is not a person, but it pushes requests in from outside, so it is drawn as an actor.\nReceiving a notification is not a use case — only the things a user asks the system to do are use cases.",
